1
00:00:03,247 --> 00:00:05,947
Saakshi
A field photo arrives.

2
00:00:06,247 --> 00:00:10,714
It reads where and when it was taken, what is in it, and its fingerprint.

3
00:00:11,664 --> 00:00:18,087
Every photo in the archive finds its place and its project.

4
00:00:19,037 --> 00:00:22,537
Four fakes are planted in the archive.

5
00:00:22,837 --> 00:00:28,617
Each one is caught by a fixed rule, with its reason.

6
00:00:29,567 --> 00:00:35,978
Change is measured from the pixels, before and after.

7
00:00:36,928 --> 00:00:43,350
Every number has a thread to its photos.

8
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:49,677
Reports a funder can check, number by number.

9
00:00:50,427 --> 00:00:55,982
Faces stay blurred. Edit the link and the server refuses it.

10
00:00:56,932 --> 00:01:04,399
Capture, simulated camera
Be a witness: stand at the spot and take the photo.

11
00:01:05,349 --> 00:01:12,816
Operator rehearsal
It lands on the Witness Wall with its score.

12
00:01:13,666 --> 00:01:17,031
A person reviews every flag, with a note on the record.
